        <div class="lemma">
          <strong>Lemma 3 (Cost of merging).</strong> Let <M
            >{tex`n_1 = \operatorname{length}(L)`}</M
          >, <M>{tex`n_2 = \operatorname{length}(R)`}</M> and $m = n_1 + n_2 \ge
